      en: ["The school is part of the global network of French international schools.", "It provides a multicultural learning environment for students of all ages.", "The campus is a hub for French-speaking cultural events in Bissau.", "It features professional-grade athletic facilities for student use.", "The institution plays a key role in preparing students for European universities.", "It is located within the central administrative and diplomatic district."],
